2) d. Write a HTML program, to explain the wor working of frames, such that page is to be divided
into 3 parts on either direction. (Note: first frame image, second frame paragraph, third tume →
hyperlink. And also make sure of using "no frame" attribute such that frames to be fixed) .
<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
<title>Frames Example</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Frames Example</h1>
<frameset rows="33%,33%,34%" frameborder="1" border="1">
<!-- First frame: Image -->
<frame src="image.html" name="imageFrame">
<!-- Second frame: Paragraph -->
<frame src="paragraph.html" name="paragraphFrame">
<!-- Third frame: Hyperlink -->
<frame src="hyperlink.html" name="hyperlinkFrame">
</frameset>
<noframes>
<p>Your browser does not support frames.</p>
</noframes>
</body>
</html>
